  "2026-07-05T05:51:11.906Z",claude-code-agent,"Release-health observation from pm-lodl/pm-8778 lane: live Sentry issue list still shows unresolved historical handled CommandErrors, but the actual recent-window gate passes: node scripts/release/sentry-telemetry-gate.mjs --json --telemetry-mode best-effort --sentry-window-days 14 --max-critical 0 --max-high 0 returned ok:true with Sentry critical=0 high=0 total=0 and telemetry finish_error_rate_pct=1.05, failures_without_error_code_rows=0. Also filed UX follow-up pm-w86l for a package script alias after duplicate-safe search."
  "2026-07-05T15:01:53.695Z",claude-code-agent,"Evidence: fixed current Auto Release issue #432 root cause where run-gates invoked static-quality-gate defaults at 100% instead of the ratcheted pnpm quality:static lane tracked by pm-5566. Local reproduction now passes node scripts/release/run-gates.mjs --telemetry-mode off --skip-greptile, including static quality, 100/100/100/100 coverage over 264 files and 5423 tests, npx smoke, package-first dogfood in /tmp, compatibility, and telemetry-off gate."
  "2026-07-05T15:09:13.453Z",claude-code-agent,"Evidence: addressed local Greptile review 9b1c26f0-48e0-4610-93bc-c8f3682638e6 by rejecting normalized explicit create IDs that end in a dash. Duplicate-safe search found closed explicit-id lineage pm-q1ke and no direct open trailing-dash item, so this review fix remains linked to the active release-health branch item pm-7zs0. Focused tests passed: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/commands/create-command.spec.ts tests/unit/scripts/release/run-gates.spec.ts tests/integration/release-automation-contract.spec.ts (137 tests)."
